---
source: crates/bitnet-cli/tests/cli_snapshot_tests.rs
expression: help
---
Serve local M4 dense-SLM health and readiness endpoints without generation

Usage: bitnet mac serve [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -c, --config <PATH>
          Configuration file path
      --model-id <MODEL_ID>
          Supported model id. Defaults to the validated Apple M4 SLM runtime artifact [default: qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct-q8_0]
      --cache-dir <PATH>
          Override model cache root. Defaults to ~/.cache/bitnet-rs/models
      --device <DEVICE>
          M4 server device route. Only apple-m4-cpu-neon is supported for full answers [default: apple-m4-cpu-neon]
      --log-level <LEVEL>
          Log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error)
      --host <HOST>
          Host to bind. Defaults to loopback for local appliance use [default: 127.0.0.1]
      --threads <N>
          Number of CPU threads
      --batch-size <SIZE>
          Batch size for processing
      --port <PORT>
          Port to bind [default: 8080]
      --strict
          Require strict cache, tokenizer, backend, and fallback behavior
      --stream
          Stream by default for later completion endpoints; health/ready do not generate
      --max-new-tokens <MAX_NEW_TOKENS>
          Default maximum new tokens for completion requests that omit max_tokens [default: 64] [aliases: --max-tokens, --n-predict]
      --temperature <TEMPERATURE>
          Default completion temperature [default: 0]
      --top-k <TOP_K>
          Default top-k setting [default: 1]
      --top-p <TOP_P>
          Default nucleus sampling top-p setting [default: 1]
      --repetition-penalty <REPETITION_PENALTY>
          Default repetition penalty [default: 1.1]
      --seed <SEED>
          Optional deterministic sampling seed
      --receipt-dir <PATH>
          Directory where later request receipts will be exported [default: target/apple-m4-local-server/receipts]
  -h, --help
          Print help
